#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/component-porting.md:8
msgid "接入通用器件或协议组件"
msgstr "Integrate a reusable device or protocol component"

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/component-porting.md:10
msgid ""
"外部器件和协议通过公开 transport、time、storage 等端口使用平台。客户私有流程、 寄存器策略、产品 "
"worker、分区和恢复决策留在外部工程。"
msgstr ""
"External devices and protocols use the platform through public transport, "
"time, storage and similar ports. Customer-specific workflows, register "
"policies, product workers, partitions and recovery decisions remain in "
"external projects."

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/component-porting.md:13
msgid "先定职责，再写适配"
msgstr "Define responsibility before adapting"

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/component-porting.md:15
msgid "明确组件是否是值得复用的算法／协议，固定输入输出、容量、单位和错误。"
msgstr ""
"Determine whether the component is a reusable algorithm/protocol, and fix "
"its inputs, outputs, capacities, units and errors."

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/component-porting.md:16
msgid "定义窄端口，不依赖 Board、SDK Handle 或具体 UART／SPI provider。"
msgstr ""
"Define narrow ports without depending on Boards, SDK Handles or specific "
"UART/SPI providers."

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/component-porting.md:17
msgid "按需求提供独立可选 adapter；parser 不隐式打开外设、分配任务或修改时钟。"
msgstr ""
"Supply independent optional adapters as needed. A parser must not implicitly"
" open peripherals, allocate tasks or change clocks."

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/component-porting.md:18
msgid "用实际业务行为、无效输入、容量耗尽和失败退出测试组件，不只测 mock 调用次数。"
msgstr ""
"Test actual behavior, invalid inputs, capacity exhaustion and failure exits,"
" rather than only mock call counts."

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/component-porting.md:19
msgid "以完整消费者验证生成头、公开 API、ABI 与链接范围，再评估实际资源成本。"
msgstr ""
"Use a complete consumer to validate generated headers, public APIs, ABI and "
"link scope, then evaluate actual resource cost."

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/component-porting.md:21
msgid "放置与连接"
msgstr "Placement and connection"

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/component-porting.md:23
msgid ""
"组件按 runtime、buses、devices、services、protocols 分类，叶目录维护代码和 CMake 依赖。普通库可直接连接公开"
" target，无需新增 TOML 类别。"
msgstr ""
"Components are grouped under runtime, buses, devices, services and "
"protocols. Leaf directories maintain code and CMake dependencies. Ordinary "
"libraries may link public targets directly without adding a TOML category."

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/component-porting.md:26
msgid ""
"确需静态绑定或供应方选择时，在 `components/catalog.json` 登记逻辑 ID、叶入口和 公开 "
"target；不在中央调度器加组件名字分支。叶目标分别声明生成公开头的 API 使用要求及 bindings 私有编译要求，避免向应用泄露私有目录。"
msgstr ""
"When static binding or supplier selection is actually required, register the"
" logical ID, leaf entry point and public target in "
"`components/catalog.json`; do not add component-name branches to a central "
"dispatcher. Leaf targets separately declare API usage requirements for "
"generated public headers and private bindings compile requirements, avoiding"
" private-directory leaks to applications."

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/component-porting.md:30
msgid "与硬件组合"
msgstr "Combine with hardware"

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/component-porting.md:32
msgid ""
"TOML 选择 transport 控制器与 endpoint，应用选择逻辑角色、执行频率、队列和静态 工作区。组件不把第一个 SPI／I2C "
"endpoint 当成整个控制器。"
msgstr ""
"TOML selects transport controllers and endpoints; the application selects "
"logical roles, execution frequency, queues and static workspaces. A "
"component must not treat the first SPI/I2C endpoint as the entire "
"controller."

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/component-porting.md:35
msgid ""
"以 RS485 为例，Board／产品描述收发器、DE／RE、电平和接线；SoC UART provider 处理其维护的传输终态；adapter "
"决定何时切方向。不能用固定软件延时替代真实线上 完成，也不能从普通 UART 成功推断整个物理协议已验证。"
msgstr ""
"For RS485, Board/product facts describe the transceiver, DE/RE, levels and "
"wiring. The SoC UART provider handles maintained transfer terminal states, "
"and an adapter decides when to change direction. A fixed software delay "
"cannot replace actual wire completion, and ordinary UART success does not "
"establish physical-protocol validation."

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/component-porting.md:39
msgid ""
"目录归属见[组件说明](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/components/README.md)，端口与公开签名见 [组件 "
"API](../reference/api/components/index.md)，执行责任见[I/O 执行](io-execution.md)。"
msgstr ""
"See the [component description](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/components/README.md) for "
"directory ownership, the [component "
"API](../reference/api/components/index.md) for ports and public signatures, "
"and [I/O execution](io-execution.md) for execution responsibilities."
